The Gnoll Slayer	25	{"kind":"quest","title":"The Gnoll Slayer","wikiPath":"/The_Gnoll_Slayer","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Qeynos Hills","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Marton Sayer","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[{"name":"Baby Joseph Sayer","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Baby_Joseph_Sayer"},{"name":"Gnoll's Eye","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Gnoll%27s_Eye"},{"name":"Journal of Greater Enchantment","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Journal_of_Greater_Enchantment"}],"rewards":[{"text":"Gnoll Slayer","item":"Gnoll Slayer","wikiPath":"/Gnoll_Slayer"},{"text":"Gnoll Slayer (final)","item":"Gnoll Slayer (final)","wikiPath":"/Gnoll_Slayer_(final)"}],"card":{"title":"The Gnoll Slayer","lines":["Minimum Level: 30","Classes: Bard, Paladin, Ranger, Rogue, Shadow Knight, Warrior","Related Zones: Blackburrow, Splitpaw Lair","Related NPCs: Lord Elgnub, a Lteth Val Scribe, a one-eyed gnoll","Faction note: Note: This quest may be completed at Dubious faction. Since the NPC happens to be a merchant, the worst your faction could possibly be is dubious."]},"links":["Qeynos Hills","Marton Sayer","Bard","Paladin","Ranger","Rogue","Shadow Knight","Warrior","Blackburrow","Splitpaw Lair","Lord Elgnub","A Lteth Val Scribe","A one-eyed gnoll","Gnoll Slayer","Gnoll Slayer (final)","Companion Spirit","Baby Joseph Sayer","Merchants of Qeynos","Circle of Unseen Hands","Antonius Bayle","Coalition of Tradefolk","Guards of Qeynos","Gnoll's Eye","Journal of Greater Enchantment"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Marton Sayer","text":"Welcome. Please stock up on provisions, especially if you are headed toward the lair of the vile gnolls. If so, I wish you much luck and many gnoll pelts!! I also have knowledge of a [powerful dog]. I pray you do not encounter him."},{"npc":"Marton Sayer","text":"I have encountered a gnoll who spoke the common tongue. He dared to call himself Lord Elgnub. He swore that some day we would cross paths and he would snatch my infant son Joseph from our home. He would stand no chance against me and the mighty [Gnoll Slayer]."},{"npc":"Marton Sayer","text":"Gnoll Slayer is the mighty longsword which was passed down unto me through generations of Sayers. My days of battle are over, but I can still wield her with ferocity. The only thing more precious would be my son, Joseph Sayer. I would trade Gnoll Slayer only for him to be safe and sound at home."},{"npc":"Marton Sayer","text":"The true potential of Gnoll Slayer is an enchantment which was once imbedded into a gnoll's eye which was placed into the hilt of the blade. The spell would help you fight off disease and call forth a wolf to fight beside you. Alas, the gnoll eye was stolen from the blade by a great, one-eyed, white gnoll. Along with the eye, the only book which explained how to return the enchantment was also stolen. I know not where this gnoll might be. If you can find the journal and the eye, return them with the Gnoll Slayer to me, for I have been searching for decades."},{"npc":"Marton Sayer","text":"The eye and the journal! What a great day! The Gnoll Slayer shall be returned to full strength because of you. Your service to Qeynos will not soon be forgotten."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-10-07T06:57:07.067Z","outOfEra":false}
